# Regenerate: vhs docs/assets/gifs/cli-doctor.tape
Output docs/assets/gifs/cli-doctor.gif

Require bash
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1008
Set Height 540
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "GitHub Dark"
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.35
Set MarginFill "#0d1117"

Type "flutter-mcp-toolkit doctor --help"
Enter
Sleep 1.8s

Type "bash docs/assets/gifs/scenarios/doctor_demo.sh"
Enter
Sleep 16s